   "body": "parent={launch}&goto=item%3Fid%3D{launch}&hmac={maker_hmac}&text=Hi+HN%2C+I%27m+Aaron+from+VideoGame+AI.+We%27re+an+AI+game+studio%3A+we+build+AI+workflows+with+game+studios+and+publishers%2C+and+the+Model+Editor+is+the+first+tool+we%27ve+released.+It%27s+open+source.%0A%0AIt%27s+a+3D+model+editor+built+on+Blender+5.2%2C+compiled+to+WebAssembly+and+run+headless.+Blender+holds+the+scene%3B+three.js+draws+the+viewport%3B+the+panels+are+React+inside+a+Code-OSS+workbench.+A+Chat+pane+runs+the+coding+agent+you+already+have+signed+in+%28Claude+Code%2C+Codex%2C+Gemini%2C+Grok%2C+or+any+model+through+your+OpenRouter+key%29%2C+and+the+agent+works+through+Blender%27s+own+Python+and+an+MCP+server%3A+it+inspects+the+scene%2C+edits+it%2C+photographs+what+it+made+and+fixes+what+it+doesn%27t+like.+Edits+save+to+an+ordinary+.blend+file+and+survive+reopening.+Agents+already+know+bpy%2C+so+we+gave+them+Blender+rather+than+a+new+modeling+API.%0A%0AThe+page+has+a+recording+of+Claude+Code+replacing+the+starter+cube+with+a+desk+lamp%2C+photographing+it%2C+dimming+a+blown-out+light+and+shooting+again.+On+a+heavier+scene+%283%2C467+meshes%2C+5.77M+triangles%2C+Material+Preview%29+the+viewport%27s+median+frame+is+22+ms%2C+p95+25.4+ms%2C+measured+on+an+M3+Pro.%0A%0AThe+limits%2C+plainly%3A%0A%0A-+macOS+on+Apple+Silicon+only%2C+with+Node.js+24.+Windows+and+Linux+aren%27t+supported+yet.%0A-+It%27s+a+local+install%2C+not+a+hosted+app%3A+%60npx+%40volter%2Fmodel-editor+create+my-models%60+makes+a+project%2C+installs+the+editor+once+and+opens+it+from+a+local+session+server.%0A-+The+viewport+and+renders+are+three.js%2C+not+Cycles%2C+and+not+at+parity+with+Blender%27s+renders.%0A-+Your+agent+runs+on+your+own+account%3B+the+editor+adds+no+charge.%0A%0AThe+editor+is+AGPL-3.0+and+Blender+is+GPL%3B+the+source+is+at+https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fvolter-ai%2Feditor%2Ftree%2Fmain%2Fpackages%2Fmodel-editor.%0A%0AI%27d+like+to+hear+what+you%27d+want+an+agent+to+model%2C+and+where+it+falls+over.",
